WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.020
If she wants someone to help, Threadline
prepares a message.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.640
She sees the words before anything is
shared.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.240
The same interface can show large captions
or describe a label.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.320
The support changes; her control doesn’t.
